 You have to remember that the traps in the dungeon affect all the inhabitants.
The cockatrice could have been hit by a poinsoned dart and killed. I have seen this
happen to my cat. a) the cat hits a polymorph trap and turns into a dragon. Great,
I say. b) beside the polymorph trap is a pit. Cat/dragon falls in pit and dies
because it STILL had only 10hp or whatever.

 As always with nethack, if you are gullible or take anything for granted, then
you are dinner.

